{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"zig","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Zig","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Zig (.zig .zon).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"zig","name":"Zig","extensions":[".zig",".zon"],"grammar":"grammars/zig.json","lineComment":"//"}],"snippets":[{"language":"Zig","path":"snippets/zig.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/zig.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:usingnamespace|linksection|threadlocal|unreachable|addrspace|allowzero|nosuspend|anyframe|callconv|comptime|continue|errdefer|noinline|volatile|anytype|noalias|suspend|export|extern|inline|opaque|orelse|packed|resume|return|struct|switch|align|async|await|break|catch|const|defer|error|union|while|else|enum|test|and|asm|for|pub|try|var|fn|if|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:undefined|false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:noreturn|anyerror|c_uint|usize|isize|c_int|bool|void|type|f128|u16|u32|u64|i16|i32|i64|f16|f32|f64|u8|i8)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/zig.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"pub fn main() !void {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"fn ${1:name}(${2:args}) ${3:void} {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:Name} = struct {\",\n      \"\\t${2:field}: ${3:u32},\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"test\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test \\\"${1:name}\\\" {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A test\"\n  },\n  \"Import std\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"std\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const std = @import(\\\"std\\\");\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Import std\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Zig\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Zig.\n\n## Files\n\n`.zig`, `.zon`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `test` | A test |\n| `std` | Import std |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}